Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:19.72,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}迷惑的代價
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:20.52,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要認同它
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.31,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}是絕命 亦是名為禮物的威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:24.56,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}你願甘心地接受他們貼上的標籤嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.81,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}因此你要直面到來的一切 不問為何
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:28.52,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}置之不理的虛假牽強附會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:29.73,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}我永遠支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:31.44,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}但是現在你必須扣下扳機
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:32.07,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}翻江倒海的緋紅色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:33.65,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}來吧! 展示你的想法!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.24,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}若不相連 善惡顛倒黑白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.28,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}吐露懺悔也不過是擲骰子的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:47.79,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}你也只想泯然眾人?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:47.79,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.00,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}帶上自己的盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.42,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}衝破牢籠 成就自己的叛逆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:54.55,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}因為你百般厭倦虛假的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:58.05,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}感受憂鬱 亂寫劇本的飢渴形成反饋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:01:59.47,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}撲倒 並且舉盾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.81,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}但是你必須反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:01.93,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}這不是在聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:04.10,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}因為你百般厭倦虛假的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.44,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}傷痕與瘀青 於超脫的次元刻印契約
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.65,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}高舉拳頭 烙印其中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.98,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要因為感到害怕而裝作他人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.40,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}進攻厄敵 斬落對方騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.78,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}今天並非你的忌日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:18.07,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}飄蕩的幻影 傳達指令
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:19.28,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要假裝自己困於其中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.45,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}你隨時可以發聲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:22.66,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}不存在放棄抵抗認輸的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:25.00,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}因此你要向天空詠唱你的咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.33,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}審判其主 追尋毀滅的原罪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.50,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}不要因為感到害怕而裝作他人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.00,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}進攻厄敵 斬落對方騎士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.55,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}今天並非你的忌日
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.38,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,0)}飄蕩的幻影 傳達指令
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:19.72,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}幻惑の対価
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:20.52,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Chya don't get it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.31,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}絶命かGIFTかの脅威
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:24.56,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}甘んじて受けるか that they tag you with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:26.81,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}So go face what's coming and don't ask why
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.81,0:01:28.52,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}度外視のfakeが牽強付会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:29.73,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}I'm always getting your back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.73,0:01:31.44,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}But now you got to grip the trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:32.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}翻す深紅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.07,0:01:33.65,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Come on! Show me how you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.24,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}繫げ さもなくば低コントラストの善悪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:38.28,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}懺悔を吐けば 骰子次第
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:47.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Just like all the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:47.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Get out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.00,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Go take some cover
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.42,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Butchya gotta break out to be the brat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:54.55,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Cuz ya tired of being just a copycat
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.55,0:01:58.05,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Feel the blues チラっく筋書き乱す飢渇をfeedback
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:01:59.47,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Duck and cover
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.47,0:02:00.81,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}But chya gotta bite back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:01.93,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}This ain't chitchat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:04.10,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Cuz ya tired of being just a copycat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:07.44,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Cuts and bruises 超俗した次元の契約を刻む
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.44,0:02:08.65,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Fist emblazoned
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:10.98,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Don't pretend to be someone you're not cuz you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.40,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}攻め込んだin check なぎ倒したKnight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:15.78,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Today's not the day for you to die
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:18.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}The drifting phantoms 下す采配
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:19.28,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Don't pretend to be trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.45,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}You can always appeal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:22.66,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}無抵抗に匙を投げるtechはない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:25.00,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}So cast all your spells up in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.33,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Judge his master 破滅問う原罪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.50,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}Don't pretend to be someone you're not cuz you feel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.00,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,200)}攻め込んだin check なぎ倒したKnight
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.55,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,0)}Today's not the day for you to die
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(200,0)}The drifting phantoms 下す采配
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:15.27,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潛在狂亂的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:18.94,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5}別再隱藏你的手牌 切勿猶豫掛懷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.15,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}{\blur5}潛在鬧騰的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.15,0:22:25.95,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5}踩著舞步為故事點綴色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:36.50,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}無雙幻想中大敗 曖昧倦怠致停塞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:40.05,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5}亂七八糟真姿態 疲憊不堪 羅列攤開怎安排
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:44.59,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5\an8}陳詞濫調淹沒我 強行壓消心頭火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:46.80,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5\an8}但求無事的現狀 難以安眠的症狀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.05,0:22:54.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}倘若繼續如此 一生將毫無意義 每天都於人掌心起舞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.31,0:23:00.98,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}擺脫困境必須之物 早已存於每個人心底
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:04.28,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潛在狂亂的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:07.99,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}別再隱藏你的手牌 切勿猶豫掛懷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:11.29,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}世俗常理難衡量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:15.21,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}每個瞬間縱情綻放 這就是獨屬於你的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.21,0:23:16.96,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}圍成圓圈鬧起來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.96,0:23:18.50,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}盡情高歌唱起來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.50,0:23:21.96,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}愉快逸事莫忘懷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:25.09,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潛在鬧騰的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.09,0:23:27.26,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}這就是真實
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:29.51,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潛在的自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:34.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潛在的自我
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.89,0:22:15.27,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潜在的狂乱のアイ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.27,0:22:18.94,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5}手の内隠さないで 遠慮は勿体ない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.94,0:22:22.15,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}{\blur5}潜在的暴かれるアイ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.15,0:22:25.95,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5}踊りだして彩られてくストーリー
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.04,0:22:36.50,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}無双幻想で大敗 曖昧 倦怠で渋滞
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.50,0:22:40.05,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5}ひっちゃかめっちゃか等身大 もうしんどい並べてどうすんだい?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.34,0:22:44.59,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5\an8}ありきたりな卓論に飲まれちゃって 極度な心頭滅却
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.59,0:22:46.80,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\blur5\an8}事勿れな現状 不眠で症
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.05,0:22:54.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}このままじゃ 彼方まで我楽多 手のひらで操られる毎日
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.31,0:23:00.98,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}抜け出す為に 欠かせないもの 全人類備えてる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.98,0:23:04.28,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潜在的狂乱のアイ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.28,0:23:07.99,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}手の内隠さないで 遠慮は勿体ない
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.99,0:23:11.29,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}一般論でははかれまい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.29,0:23:15.21,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}瞬き肝心 アナタだけのアイ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.21,0:23:16.96,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}騒ごうよ輪になって
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.96,0:23:18.50,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}鳴らそうよ声張って
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.50,0:23:21.96,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}楽しむ事を忘れないで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.96,0:23:25.09,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潜在的暴かれたアイ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.09,0:23:27.26,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}それが真実
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.26,0:23:29.51,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潜在的なアイ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.68,0:23:34.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\blur5}潜在的なアイ
